(text "THUMB BUTTONS / INTERNAL PULLUPS" (at 172.72 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 8ae04877-1dfe-589e-8e74-c991b997e364))
(text "Joystick: GPIO0/1, ADC 12 dB attenuation, 10k/22k dividers limit full-scale to 2.27 V.\nBattery: GPIO3 reads VBUS/2. Buttons GPIO10/20/21: internal pull-ups.\nI2C GPIO6/7: pull-ups on OLED module. No boot strapping pins used.\nBattery OFF + JP1 open before USB. Onboard diode does NOT isolate a battery sharing USB VBUS.\nSingle externally charged 18650. Test low-voltage operation with the actual SuperMini." (at 17.78 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid ce8fe817-0af7-512d-91e4-69a9e41103ec)) (embedded_fonts no))